Title: chore: remove redundant failing Pages workflow

This PR deletes the custom `.github/workflows/deploy-pages.yml` workflow which was failing and creating noisy failed runs.

Rationale:
- The built-in GitHub Pages "pages build and deployment" process is already successfully deploying the site on pushes to main.
- Removing the redundant failing workflow keeps Pages deployments clean and reduces noise.

If you'd like a custom deploy workflow instead, I can add a corrected version in a follow-up PR.
